SamenvattingStep into the world of logistics as an Orderpicker at Albert Heijn. This is your chance to join a dynamic team, develop your skills, and enjoy real growth opportunities in a modern warehouse environment. Good work!Over de functieAs an Orderpicker at Albert Heijn Bleiswijk, you play a vital role in keeping the online orders running smoothly. Your daily routine includes picking orders with a handheld scanner, checking the quality of products, and managing stock levels. With the scanner, you’ll see exactly which item goes to which location, scan barcodes, and ensure every order is accurate. You’ll work in a modern warehouse, often in cool conditions to keep products fresh. The environment is lively, with team members supporting each other to get the job done. 
Your main tasks are:
- Picking online orders using a scanner;
- Checking order quality before shipment;
- Managing and organizing stock in the warehouse;
- Following clear location and barcode systems;
- Collaborating with your team to meet daily targets.

You’ll work in a 3-shift system: 
- Morningshift: 06:00 – 14:30;
- Afternoonshift: 14:30 – 23:00; 
- Nightshift: 23:00 – 06:00.

Over het bedrijfYou will be working at the Albert Heijn warehouse in Bleiswijk, where groceries are collected and prepared for shipment on a daily basis. Together with your colleagues, you ensure that orders are processed accurately and on time. You will join a diverse team where colleagues help one another and work together to achieve daily goals. Naturally, you won't be on your own as a new team member; you will receive guidance from a buddy to help you quickly learn the ropes and find your place within the team.
Wat wij vragen- Own accommodation in The Netherlands. For this job we don't provide housing;
- At least 1 year of experience as an Orderpicker or in a similar logistical job;
- Able to communicate in English at a basic level;
- Willing to work in a 3-shift system and on weekends;
- Working in a cold enviro

